            },
            {
              "text": "He wanted someone to come up and talk to him.",
              "audioStart": 30.637,
              "audioEnd": 32.8
            },
            {
              "text": "Life on the green ground was slow.",
              "audioStart": 33.663,
              "audioEnd": 35.45
            },
            {
              "text": "Days passed quickly, but nothing new ever happened there.",
              "audioStart": 36.312,
              "audioEnd": 39.312
            },
            {
              "text": "Therefore, the mind of the boy turned toward a funny plan.",
              "audioStart": 40.175,
              "audioEnd": 43.212
            },
            {
              "text": "He thought that a game might bring some excitement into his day.",
              "audioStart": 44.075,
              "audioEnd": 47
            },
            {
              "text": "Without any real danger present, he decided to create a strange emergency.",
              "audioStart": 47.862,
              "audioEnd": 51.975
            },
            {
              "text": "It seemed like a simple idea at first.",
              "audioStart": 52.837,
              "audioEnd": 55.025
            },
            {
              "text": "He did not know how serious the result would eventually become.",
              "audioStart": 55.888,
              "audioEnd": 58.962
            },
            {
              "text": "Every afternoon looked the same until that moment.",
              "audioStart": 59.825,
              "audioEnd": 62.312
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun shone brightly over the grass.",
              "audioStart": 63.175,
              "audioEnd": 65.275
            },
            {
              "text": "The sheep moved slowly across the field, eating day after day.",
              "audioStart": 66.138,
              "audioEnd": 69.463
            },
            {
              "text": "Nothing unusual disturbed the peace.",
              "audioStart": 70.325,
              "audioEnd": 72.25
            },
            {
              "text": "The quiet environment made the hours feel extremely long.",
              "audioStart": 73.112,
              "audioEnd": 76.275
            },
            {
              "text": "The child wanted a change, no matter what it took.",
              "audioStart": 77.138,
              "audioEnd": 79.912
            },
            {
              "text": "He looked down toward the houses far away.",
              "audioStart": 80.775,
              "audioEnd": 82.925
            },
            {
              "text": "He imagined the surprise on the faces of the people if they ran up to help him.",
              "audioStart": 83.787,
              "audioEnd": 87.662
            },
            {
              "text": "The thought brought a smile to his face, though it was a bad choice.",
              "audioStart": 88.525,
              "audioEnd": 91.825
            },
            {
              "text": "He prepared his voice to shout as loud as he could.",
              "audioStart": 92.688,
              "audioEnd": 95.25
            },
            {
              "text": "He wanted everyone to hear his call for help.",
              "audioStart": 96.112,
              "audioEnd": 98.388
            },
            {
              "text": "The trick was ready to begin.",
              "audioStart": 99.25,
              "audioEnd": 100.787
            },
            {
              "text": "He took a deep breath and opened his mouth.",
              "audioStart": 101.65,
              "audioEnd": 103.85
            },
            {
              "text": "The silence of the afternoon was about to end in a very big way.",
              "audioStart": 104.713,
              "audioEnd": 107.9
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Standing high upon the rock, the boy shouted with all his might.",
              "audioStart": 108.763,
              "audioEnd": 112.237
            },
            {
              "text": "He cried that a wild animal was attacking his sheep.",
              "audioStart": 113.1,
              "audioEnd": 115.787
            },
            {
              "text": "The local people heard his cry from down below.",
              "audioStart": 116.65,
              "audioEnd": 119.1
            },
            {
              "text": "They immediately dropped their daily work.",
              "audioStart": 119.963,
              "audioEnd": 122.025
            },
            {
              "text": "They rushed up the hill as fast as they could to help him save the animals.",
              "audioStart": 122.888,
              "audioEnd": 126.475
            },
            {
              "text": "However, when they arrived, they found no threat at all, only a laughing boy.",
              "audioStart": 127.338,
              "audioEnd": 131.625
            },
            {
              "text": "They looked around the area with care, but saw nothing dangerous.",
              "audioStart": 132.488,
              "audioEnd": 135.963
            },
            {
              "text": "The animals were eating grass quietly.",
              "audioStart": 136.825,
              "audioEnd": 138.912
            },
            {
              "text": "The boy stood there, laughing at the crowd.",
              "audioStart": 139.775,
              "audioEnd": 142.062
            },
            {
              "text": "The people felt quite upset about the joke.",
              "audioStart": 142.925,
              "audioEnd": 145.125
            },
            {
              "text": "They had left important tasks behind to answer his call.",
              "audioStart": 145.988,
              "audioEnd": 148.95
            },
            {
              "text": "Such behavior made everyone very sad.",
              "audioStart": 149.812,
              "audioEnd": 152.075
            },
            {
              "text": "They walked back down to their homes with heavy steps.",
              "audioStart": 152.938,
              "audioEnd": 155.6
            },
            {
              "text": "A short time later, the boy played the exact same trick a second time.",
              "audioStart": 156.463,
              "audioEnd": 160.425
            },
            {
              "text": "Once again, the helpful people ran up the green area.",
              "audioStart": 161.287,
              "audioEnd": 164.338
            },
            {
              "text": "They discovered that they had been cheated.",
              "audioStart": 165.2,
              "audioEnd": 167
            },
            {
              "text": "They were very angry because he had wasted their valuable time twice.",
              "audioStart": 167.863,
              "audioEnd": 171.438
            },
            {
              "text": "The situation was clear to everyone involved.",
              "audioStart": 172.3,
              "audioEnd": 174.812
            },
            {
              "text": "No one likes to be made a fool of by a child.",
              "audioStart": 175.675,
              "audioEnd": 178.05
            },
            {
              "text": "The crowd spoke strong words to the boy before leaving again.",
              "audioStart": 178.912,
              "audioEnd": 182.05
            },
            {
              "text": "They warned him not to do it ever again.",
              "audioStart": 182.912,
              "audioEnd": 184.775
            },
            {
              "text": "The boy just smiled and did not listen to their advice.",
              "audioStart": 185.637,
              "audioEnd": 188.537
            },
            {
              "text": "He thought the game was still very funny.",
              "audioStart": 189.4,
              "audioEnd": 191.375
            },
            {
              "text": "He did not understand the damage he was causing to trust.",
              "audioStart": 192.238,
              "audioEnd": 195.137
            },
            {
              "text": "Trust is a hard thing to build and an easy thing to lose.",
              "audioStart": 196,
              "audioEnd": 198.988
            },
            {
              "text": "The people went back to their normal routines.",
              "audioStart": 199.85,
              "audioEnd": 202.088
            },
            {
              "text": "They tried to forget the incident and focus on their jobs.",
              "audioStart": 202.95,
              "audioEnd": 205.812
            },
            {
              "text": "However, the memory remained in their minds.",
              "audioStart": 206.675,
              "audioEnd": 209.037
            },
            {
              "text": "They felt that the child could not be trusted anymore.",
              "audioStart": 209.9,
              "audioEnd": 212.475
            },
            {
              "text": "The stage was set for a real disaster.",
              "audioStart": 213.338,
              "audioEnd": 215.438
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "Later that same week, a real animal truly did appear among the sheep on the green area.",
              "audioStart": 216.3,
              "audioEnd": 220.9
            },
            {
              "text": "The frightened boy watched the dangerous creature approach his group.",
              "audioStart": 221.762,
              "audioEnd": 224.875
            },
            {
              "text": "He became completely afraid.",
              "audioStart": 225.738,
              "audioEnd": 227.425
            },
            {
              "text": "He cried out for help with all his strength.",
              "audioStart": 228.287,
              "audioEnd": 230.375
            },
            {
              "text": "He was asking someone to come and save him.",
              "audioStart": 231.238,
              "audioEnd": 233.4
            },
            {
              "text": "If the villagers had known the truth, they would have rushed up immediately.",
              "audioStart": 234.262,
              "audioEnd": 237.675
            },
            {
              "text": "However, the people in the town heard his shouts and simply ignored them.",
              "audioStart": 238.537,
              "audioEnd": 242.312
            },
            {
              "text": "They were completely sure that it was just another bad trick from the bad child.",
              "audioStart": 243.175,
              "audioEnd": 247
            },
            {
              "text": "No one moved to help him.",
              "audioStart": 247.863,
              "audioEnd": 249.275
            },
            {
              "text": "They all stayed safely in their homes.",
              "audioStart": 250.137,
              "audioEnd": 252.037
            },
            {
              "text": "The poor boy learned the hard way that no one believes someone who tells lies.",
              "audioStart": 252.9,
              "audioEnd": 256.688
            },
            {
              "text": "Even when he is finally telling the truth, no one listens.",
              "audioStart": 257.55,
              "audioEnd": 260.738
            },
            {
              "text": "The danger was real this time, but help never came.",
              "audioStart": 261.6,
              "audioEnd": 264.488
            },
            {
              "text": "The animals ran in fear as the creature drew closer.",
              "audioStart": 265.35,
              "audioEnd": 268.125
            },
            {
              "text": "The boy realized his massive mistake too late.",
              "audioStart": 268.988,
              "audioEnd": 271.587
            },
            {
              "text": "He stood alone against the threat.",
              "audioStart": 272.45,
              "audioEnd": 275.531
            },
            {
              "text": "His voice grew weak from shouting so much.",
              "audioStart": 276.394,
              "audioEnd": 278.756
            },
            {
              "text": "No friendly faces appeared on the path below.",
              "audioStart": 279.618,
              "audioEnd": 282.056
            },
            {
              "text": "The windows of the houses remained closed.",
              "audioStart": 282.918,
              "audioEnd": 285.068
            },
            {
              "text": "The townspeople stayed inside, talking among themselves.",
              "audioStart": 285.931,
              "audioEnd": 289.131
            },
            {
              "text": "They assumed he was just playing his game once more.",
              "audioStart": 289.993,
              "audioEnd": 292.493
            },
            {
              "text": "The consequences of his past actions caught up with him fully.",
              "audioStart": 293.356,
              "audioEnd": 296.631
            },
            {
              "text": "He watched quietly as the situation slipped out of his control.",
              "audioStart": 297.493,
              "audioEnd": 300.781
            },
            {
              "text": "The story ends with a clear lesson about truth.",
              "audioStart": 301.644,
              "audioEnd": 304.094
            },
            {
              "text": "People must always tell the truth if they want to be believed.",
              "audioStart": 304.956,
              "audioEnd": 307.831
            },
            {
              "text": "A person who makes a habit of bad behavior will find no support when a real crisis occurs.",
              "audioStart": 308.693,
              "audioEnd": 313.493
            },
            {
              "text": "This fact remains true across all times and places.",
              "audioStart": 314.356,
              "audioEnd": 317.331
            },
            {
              "text": "The boy stood on the rock, regretting every part of his foolish game.",
              "audioStart": 318.193,
              "audioEnd": 321.831
            },
            {
              "text": "The sun went down, and the day ended in sorrow.",
              "audioStart": 322.693,
              "audioEnd": 325.344
            },
            {
              "text": "He took his remaining animals and walked home slowly.",
              "audioStart": 326.206,
              "audioEnd": 328.981
            },
            {
              "text": "He knew that things would never be the same again.",
              "audioStart": 329.844,
              "audioEnd": 332.068
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "audio": "audio/b2/st-0150.mp3",
      "wordTimings": "audio/b2/st-0150.timings.json",
